Series.; Series.

@AC 1058. Evident from the series of the Things. @2161. @2162. @2163. @2166. @2221. @2953. @3942. @3983. @3984. @4289. @4369. @4379. @4422[end]. @4439. @4443. @4455. @4581[2]. @4992. @5432. @6391. @6750. @6848. @7031.

@1659. The internal sense is in a continuous series. @2102[end]. @2654.

