@3304[3]. The historicals are in their series, and the spiritual things of the internal sense, in theirs.

@3900[end]. (Thus) these things are in a most beautiful series, although it does not appear so.

@3952. These things cannot be comprehended unless they are set forth in one series...

@4301. (The delight of the eye is) according to the order, or the dispositions into series.

