@269. Their words are varied in infinite modes according to the series of the Things...

@323. From one idea of thought they could know the entire series... @SE 4330.

@DLW 214. In a series of like degrees...

@215. The ultimate of each series...

@DP 202[3]. Each change... changes something in the series of present and consequent things.

