@106[end]. "Servants" = those not conjoined with the Lord.

@495. Freedom which is from Hell is slavery -servum-. (Explained.)

@WE 4477. A state of spiritual servitude, described. From experience.

@SE 1735. An Angel, on hearing the word servant, put it on, and prayed from it...

@2504. Those who labour they suppose to be servants. Described.

@2924. Evil Spirits regard man as a vile slave. Explained.

@3086. Those led by Him long to serve even the worst; even if their enemies. Explained.

@3648[end]. Such call themselves servants of servants; yet claim all Power.

