@911[4]. "The servants" of the Lord (Matthew 13:27) = those in truths from good.

@1202. "The blood of His servants" (Revelation 19:2) = violence to those in truths from Him.

@1210. "Praise God all His servants" (verse 5) = worship by those in truths.

